==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.
**5 [[Unicycle Cat (Enemy)|Unicycle Cats]] spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The [[Unicycle Cat (Enemy)|Unicycle Cats]] may be strong, but their time between attacks is all backswing, making it possible to sync all of them using the default [[Cat Cannon]] and greatly reduce their ability to push; and while they do outrange [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], they still can't reach [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] or most [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]]. Proper meatshielding and backliners that outrange the Unicycles are the essence of this stage. (Ururun can be replaced by [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]).

